div><p class="xsignal__src">clinicaltrials.gov</p></div><div class="xsignal" style="--i:1"><div class="xsignal__row"><p class="xsignal__title">FDA grants Fast Track to a KRAS inhibitor</p><span class="timestamp">1H AGO</span></div><p class="xsignal__src">fda.gov</p></div><div class="xsignal" style="--i:2"><div class="xsignal__row"><p class="xsignal__title">Competitor reports positive Phase 3 topline</p><span class="timestamp">5H AGO</span></div><p class="xsignal__src">businesswire.com</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="workflow__list"><div class="witem is-open"><button type="button" class="witem__head" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="witem-body-monitor"><span class="witem__title">Monitor portfolios, signals, and pricing</span></button><div id="witem-body-monitor" class="witem__body"><div class="witem__inner"><div class="witem__pad"><p class="witem__text m-0">Watch the things your business runs on: portfolio companies, target accounts, competitor pricing, regulations. Get a structured alert the moment something material changes, so you only hear what matters to you.</p><div class="witem__tabs"><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/finance"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Finance</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/life-sciences"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Life Sciences</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/sales"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Sales</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/insurance"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Insurance</span></a></div><div class="witem__cta"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/play/monitor" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] text-invert bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-secondary-hover border-transparent active:bg-surface-secondary disabled:text-tertiary disabled:bg-surface-secondary-hover text-body-sm machine:hidden workflow__button"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Try Monitor</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/play/monitor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->Try Monitor<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/play/monitor<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="witem"><button type="button" class="witem__head" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="witem-body-answer"><span class="witem__title">Answer with fresh facts, inside your product</span></button><div id="witem-body-answer" class="witem__body" inert=""><div class="witem__inner"><div class="witem__pad"><p class="witem__text m-0">Give your assistant, copilot, or coding agent current, cited answers fast enough for a chat thread: live docs, real-world context, breaking news. Your users get the answer that&#x27;s relevant today, not at training time.</p><div class="witem__tabs"><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/productivity"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Productivity</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/code"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Coding &amp; Building</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/legal"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Legal</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/finance"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-no