xt-body-sm machine:hidden workflow__button"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Try Deep Research</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/play/task" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->Try Deep Research<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/play/task<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="witem"><button type="button" class="witem__head" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="witem-body-enrich"><span class="witem__title">Enrich companies, people, and accounts</span></button><div id="witem-body-enrich" class="witem__body" inert=""><div class="witem__inner"><div class="witem__pad"><p class="witem__text m-0">Drop in a list or describe who you&#x27;re looking for. Get back live, structured profiles: target accounts, investment candidates, vendors, or the long tail. Every field cited and confidence-scored, ready for your CRM or pipeline.</p><div class="witem__tabs"><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/sales"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Sales</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/life-sciences"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Life Sciences</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/finance"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Finance</span></a><a class="witem__tablink inline-flex shrink-0 appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 m-0 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="/solutions/insurance"><span class="relative z-[1] text-body-sm font-mono px-2 py-1.5 not-machine:leading-none not-machine:rounded-sm inline-flex items-center machine:inline machine:p-0 bg-surface-primary-hover text-primary">Insurance</span></a></div><div class="witem__cta"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/play/find-all" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] text-invert bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-secondary-hover border-transparent active:bg-surface-secondary disabled:text-tertiary disabled:bg-surface-secondary-hover text-body-sm machine:hidden workflow__button"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Try FindAll</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/play/find-all" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->Try FindAll<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/play/find-all<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip pw-home feature feature--sources not-machine:hidden"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div><div><div class="py-(--space-80) machine:py-(--space-24)"><h2 class="text-title-md text-primary m-0">Better answers start with better web search</h2><p class="text-body-md text-secondary m-0">Parallel gives agents real-time access to fresh and relevant context from the web. Search billions of pages, extract key information, monitor changes, and do complex research with cited outputs you can trust in production.</p><div class="flex gap-(--space-8) flex-wrap pt-(--space-8)"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">API Playground</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->API Playground<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-(--space-16) pt-(--space-16)"><p class="font-mono text-body-sm text-secondary m-0">What do I need to know for my meeting tomorrow?</p><div><h3 class="text-body-md text-primary m-0">With Parallel retrieval</h3><p class="text-body-md text-secondary m-0">The company closed a $40M Series B last week and has been hiring aggressively in enterprise sales since, a signal they&#x27;re moving upmarket. The lead contact joined as VP of Product in January, previously led product at a direct competitor, and published a piece last week flagging retrieval quality as their biggest infrastructure gap.</p><p class="font-mono text-body-sm text-secondary m-0">High confidence</p></div><div><h3 class="text-body-md text-primary m-0">LLM only</h3><p class="text-body-md text-secondary m-0">The company is an enterprise SaaS business focused on workflow automation, backed by Sequoia and Index Ventures. The lead contact is a senior product leader who previously worked at Salesforce. They&#x27;ve been growing their enterprise segment and expanding internationally.</p><p class="font-mono text-body-sm text-secondary m-0"></p></div></div></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip pw-home feature feature--sources machine:hidden py-(--space-80)"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full min-[1600px]:not-machine:[&amp;&gt;:first-child]:hidden min-[1600px]:not-machine:[&amp;&gt;:last-child]:hidden"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div><div><div><div class="feature__grid feature__grid--text-left"><div class="feature__copy reveal" data-in="false"><h3 class="text-title-sm text-primary m-0 text-balance">Better answers start with better web search</h3><p class="text-body-md font-medium text-secondary m-0">Parallel gives agents real-time access to fresh and relevant context from the web. Search billions of pages, extract key information, monitor changes, and do complex research with cited outputs you can trust in production.</p><div class="feature__cta"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">API Playground</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->API Playground<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div><div class="feature__divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="feature__media"><div class="spot "><div class="xgroup"><div class="xcard xcard--query"><div class="xquery"><span class="xquery__icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.7499 15.7501L12.4949 12.4951M14.25 8.25C14.25 11.5637 11.5637 14.25 8.25 14.25C4.93629 14.25 2.25 11.5637 2.25 8.25C2.25 4.93629 4.93629 2.25 8.25 2.25C11.5637 2.25 14.25 4.93629 14.25 8.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><p class="xquery__text"><span class="type" data-type="What do I need to know for my meeting tomorrow?">What do I need to know for my meeting tomorrow?</span><span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></p></div></div><div class="answer" style="--pos:50%"><div class="answer__layer answer__layer--llm"><div class="answer__col"><span class="answer__tag">LLM only</span><div class="answer__text"><span class="eyebrow">Your agent</span><p class="answer__body"><span>The company is an enterprise SaaS business focused on workflow automation, backed by Sequoia and Index Ventures. The lead contact is a senior product leader who previously worked at Salesforce. They&#x27;ve been growing their enterprise segment and expanding internationally.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="answer__layer answer__layer--parallel"><div class="answer__col"><span class="answer__tag">With Parallel retrieval</span><div class="answer__text"><span class="eyebrow">Your agent</span><p class="answer__body"><span>The company closed a </span><span class="answer__em">$40M Series B</span><span> last week and has been hiring aggressively in enterprise sales since, a signal they&#x27;re moving upmarket. The lead contact </span><span class="answer__em">joined as VP of Product in January</span><span>, previously led product at a direct competitor, and published a piece last week flagging </span><span class="answer__em">retrieval quality as their biggest infrastructure gap</span><span>.</span></p></div></div><div class="chips answer__chips"><span class="chip chip--ok"><span class="check" style="width:14px;height:14px" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="10.92" height="10.92" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M11.25 5.16699L5.40625 10.8337L2.75 8.2579" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>High confidence</span></div></div><div class="answer__line" aria-hidden="true"></div><button type="button" class="answer__handle" role="slider" aria-orientation="horizontal" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="50" aria-label="Drag to compare Parallel and LLM results"><svg width="22" height="16" viewBox="0 0 22 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4 4 8l4 4M14 4 18 8l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip pw-home feature feature--search not-machine:hidden"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div><div><div class="py-(--space-80) machine:py-(--space-24)"><h2 class="text-title-md text-primary m-0">Designed to compose</h2><p class="text-body-md text-secondary m-0">With Parallel, agents can find quick answers, watch the web for changes, enrich databases, and do deep research across the deepest corners of the web, all through a single API.</p><div class="flex gap-(--space-8) flex-wrap pt-(--space-8)"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">API Playground</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" target="_blank" rel=