, agents can find quick answers, watch the web for changes, enrich databases, and do deep research across the deepest corners of the web, all through a single API.</p><div class="feature__cta"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">API Playground</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->API Playground<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip pw-home feature feature--provenance not-machine:hidden"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div><div><div class="py-(--space-80) machine:py-(--space-24)"><h2 class="text-title-md text-primary m-0">Production-grade trust</h2><p class="text-body-md text-secondary m-0">Parallel&#x27;s Web Agents use <a href="https://docs.parallel.ai/task-api/guides/access-research-basis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-(--color-orange-100) no-underline">Basis</a> to attach provenance and calibrated confidence scoring to every output, for trusted use and auditability in production. Every score can be fed back into retrieval to continuously improve results over time.</p><div class="flex gap-(--space-8) flex-wrap pt-(--space-8)"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">API Playground</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->API Playground<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip pw-home feature feature--provenance machine:hidden py-(--space-80)"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full min-[1600px]:not-machine:[&amp;&gt;:first-child]:hidden min-[1600px]:not-machine:[&amp;&gt;:last-child]:hidden"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div><div><div><div class="feature__grid feature__grid--text-left"><div class="feature__copy reveal" data-in="false"><h3 class="text-title-sm text-primary m-0 text-balance">Production-grade trust</h3><p class="text-body-md font-medium text-secondary m-0">Parallel&#x27;s Web Agents use <a href="https://docs.parallel.ai/task-api/guides/access-research-basis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-(--color-orange-100) no-underline">Basis</a> to attach provenance and calibrated confidence scoring to every output, for trusted use and auditability in production. Every score can be fed back into retrieval to continuously improve results over time.</p><div class="feature__cta"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">API Playground</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->API Playground<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div><div class="feature__divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="feature__media"><div class="feature__card pw-views" aria-hidden="true"><div class="stack stack--vignette"><div class="stack__item" style="--i:0;background-image:url(/views/art/tex-home1.webp);background-position:0% 0%"><div class="stack__item__inner"><div class="xgroup verify"><div class="verify__doc"><div class="xcard verify__answer"><p class="brief__body"><span>The World Wide Web was invented by </span><span class="hl">Tim Berners Lee<sup class="cite">[<!-- -->1<!-- -->]</sup></span><span> at </span><span class="hl">CERN<sup class="cite">[<!-- -->2<!-- -->]</sup></span><span> in </span><span class="hl">1989<sup class="cite">[<!-- -->3<!-- -->]</sup></span><span>.</span></p></div><div class="xcard verify__basis"><span class="chip chip--ok"><span class="check" style="width:14px;height:14px" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="10.92" height="10.92" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M11.25 5.16699L5.40625 10.8337L2.75 8.2579" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span> HIGH CONFIDENCE</span><div class="verify__cols"><div class="verify__col"><p class="verify__field">“Tim Berners-Lee”</p><div class="verify__meter"><span class="verify__meter-track"><span class="verify__meter-fill" style="width:99%"></span></span><span class="verify__meter-val">0.99</span></div><div class="source"><span class="source__n">[<!-- -->1<!-- -->]</span><span class="source__link">cern.ch</span></div></div><div class="verify__col"><p class="verify__field">“CERN”</p><div class="verify__meter"><span class="verify__meter-track"><span class="verify__meter-fill" style="width:94%"></span></span><span class="verify__meter-val">0.94</span></div><div class="source"><span class="source__n">[<!-- -->2<!-- -->]</span><span class="source__link">britannica.com</span></div></div><div class="verify__col"><p class="verify__field">“1989”</p><div class="verify__meter"><span class="verify__meter-track"><span class="verify__meter-fill" style="width:98%"></span></span><span class="verify__meter-val">0.98</span></div><div class="source"><span class="source__n">[<!-- -->3<!-- -->]</span><span class="source__link">w3.org</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="xcard xcard--code verify__json"><code class="vjson"><span class="vword">{</span><span>
  </span><span class="vword vjson__k">&quot;content&quot;</span><span class="vword">:</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">&quot;The</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">World</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">Wide</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">Web</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">was</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">invented</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">by</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">Tim</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">Berners-Lee</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">[1]</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">at</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">CERN</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">[2]</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">in</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">1989</span><span> </span><span class="vword vjson__s">[3].&quot;</span><span class="vword">,</span><span>
