r-agent" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Onboard your agent<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex gap-1 text-[11px] leading-[8px] items-center machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm h-4 min-w-4 px-0.5 bg-opaque-300"><span>A</span></span></span></span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://docs.parallel.ai/getting-started/overview#onboard-your-agent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->Onboard your agent<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex gap-1 text-[11px] leading-[8px] items-center machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm h-4 min-w-4 px-0.5 bg-opaque-300"><span>A</span></span></span>]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://docs.parallel.ai/getting-started/overview#onboard-your-agent<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip pw-home products-overview machine:hidden pt-(--space-80)"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)