op:59.5px"><img src="/home/products/v2/extract-dots-blue.svg" alt="" width="16" height="16"/><span class="ov__mono-label">Extracting</span></div><i class="ov__thread" style="left:69.5px;top:79.5px;bottom:0"></i><div class="ov__field" style="left:87px;top:85.5px;width:432px"><span class="ove__label">URLs</span><span class="ove__chip">https://arxiv.org/pdf/1706.03762</span></div><div class="ov__panel" style="left:87px;top:138.5px;width:432px;height:181px"><i class="ove__bar ov__bar" style="left:16px;top:12px;width:372px"></i><i class="ove__bar ov__bar--dim" style="left:15.5px;top:37px;width:327px"></i><i class="ove__bar ov__bar--dim" style="left:15.5px;top:62px;width:346px"></i></div></div></div><div class="ovcard__head"><span class="ovcard__chip"><img src="/home/products/icon-extract.svg" alt="" width="16" height="16"/></span><h4 class="ovcard__title m-0">Extract</h4></div><p class="ovcard__desc m-0">Get full or excerpted contents from the public web, including PDFs, JS-heavy pages, and government sites</p></a><a class="ovcard" href="https://platform.parallel.ai/play/find-all"><div class="ovcard__art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ovcard__ghost"></div><div class="ovcard__scene"><div class="ov__pill" style="left:62px;top:61.5px;width:446px"><img src="/home/products/icon-findall.svg" alt="" width="18" height="18"/>Companies building web agents</div><div class="ovf__table" style="left:61.5px;top:113.5px"><div class="pv-fa__row pv-fa__row--head"><div class="pv-fa__cell pv-fa__cell--id">ID</div><div class="pv-fa__cell pv-fa__cell--entity"><i class="pv-fa__vdiv"></i><img src="/home/products/v2/findall-col-entity.svg" alt="" style="width:11.54px;height:11.54px"/>Company</div><div class="pv-fa__cell pv-fa__cell--c3"><i class="pv-fa__vdiv"></i><img src="/home/products/v2/findall-col-diamond.svg" alt="" style="width:11.54px;height:11.54px"/>Product releases</div><div class="pv-fa__cell pv-fa__cell--c4"><i class="pv-fa__vdiv"></i><img src="/home/products/v2/findall-col-diamond