="flex flex-col gap-(--space-16)"><h2 class="text-balance text-title-sm">Pay for answers, not tokens</h2><p class="text-body-md font-medium text-secondary">Every Parallel API flexes to fit your needs. Dial speed, depth, and cost to what each workflow is worth, set a budget cap, and hold to it. Per-request pricing means you pay for answers, not tokens, so there’s no incentive to burn context and no surprise bill at the end of the month.</p></div><div class="flex gap-(--space-8) flex-wrap"><a class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary border-stroke-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-secondary active:text-primary active:border-text-primary disabled:text-tertiary text-body-sm machine:hidden uppercase" href="/pricing"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Pricing</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="/ai/pricing" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->Pricing<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://parallel.ai/pricing<!-- -->)</span></a></span></div></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip py-(--space-80) machine:py-(--space-24) pw-home not-machine:hidden"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div><div